{"version":1,"content":"<p>Take-Two在季度財報中確認，《GTA6》的預購走勢遠高於公司最初預期，但沒有公佈具體數量。早期報告稱，售價100美元的數字豪華版目前甚至比80美元的普通版賣得更多。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585678.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.293275+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T23:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"4f1e462767ae0578beae00ca058b3726133bba74928cb0386a7dd21d3be006ab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}